{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1385020-mind-over-matter-new-psionic-edges","id":1385020,"title":"Mind Over Matter: New Psionic Edges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-30T23:57:28-07:00","id":1385020,"title":"Mind Over Matter: New Psionic Edges","content":"I wrote a booklet for \u00c6on and put it up on DriveThruRPG: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/311934/Mind-Over-Matter?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...west_community</a> <br /> <br /> It contains over 30 new psionic Edges for \u00c6on characters! Several of them inspired by the alternative psi powers from the original \u00c6on Trinity game, you can find psi specialties and tricks for a character of any Aptitude.<br /> <br /> It is pay what you want! Suggested price $1.99.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3453-nephandi","name":"Nephandi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T05:56:09-07:00","id":1385065,"title":"","content":"Great book! Congratulations!<br /> <br /> The edge ideas are great, at least all that I read was great.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 05-01-2020, 09:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T11:11:59-07:00","id":1385094,"title":"","content":"Okay so just bought it and honestly wow, really good work. The idea of using Edges to represent variant uses of the core powers is brilliant to me. As is the idea that some of these might be used without the Edge but at +2 (or more) difficulty, but that having the Edge brings it down to normal levels. <br /> <br /> I really like what you have done with prerequisites, having it not just be mode but also skill and/or attribute was brilliant. <br /> <br /> Honestly, after having read the book, yeah, this is awesome. Its a really cool source of new ideas and it really does wonders to indicate what Psions (and kin) could potentially do and reach and such. <br /> <br /> Very much like it, very glad to have bought it, and very happy that you wrote it. So thank you very much!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","ti